<section class="source-text source-copy project-section" style="--source-space:96px;--source-height:99px" data-source-section="1351:2309"><div data-node-id="1351:2309" data-name="Copy / RECOVERY AS A RECORD" class="content-stretch flex gap-[60px] items-start min-h-[99px] relative shrink-0 w-[1344px]"><div data-node-id="I1351:2309;1112:493" data-name="Label" class="content-stretch flex flex-col items-start relative shrink-0 w-[330px]"><p data-node-id="I1351:2309;1112:494" class="[word-break:break-word] font-['Hanken_Grotesk'] font-bold font-bold leading-[1.6] relative shrink-0 text-[color:#0a0a0a] text-[length:12px] tracking-[0.96px] uppercase w-[300px]">RECOVERY AS A RECORD</p></div><div data-node-id="I1351:2309;1112:495" data-name="Copy" class="content-stretch flex flex-col items-start relative shrink-0 w-[954px]"><p data-node-id="I1351:2309;1112:496" class="[word-break:break-word] font-['Hanken_Grotesk'] font-normal leading-[1.5] relative shrink-0 text-[color:#0a0a0a] text-[length:22px] w-[930px]">The 2025 chapter follows a period of recovery through voice journals, running, sleep and daily observation. Personal records become a visual account of change, connecting the measured rhythms of the body with the experience of living through them.</p></div></div></section>
